    {
      "text": "验证：直线族 $M_t: x+2ty-t^2=0$ 的包络上的点 $(-y^2, y)$ 对应参数 $t=y$。",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "包络点的参数对应"
      ],
      "question_type": "包络参数化",
      "method": [
        "二重根判别式"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "点在包络上 $\\Rightarrow$ $t^2-2ty-(-y^2)=0$ 有二重根 $\\Rightarrow$ $\\Delta=4y^2+4y^2=0$ 矛盾；重新：若 $x=-y^2$ 则 $t^2-2ty+y^2=0$，得 $(t-y)^2=0$，即 $t=y$"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "double_root",
        "template": "包络处方程有重根",
        "variable_count": 2
      },
      "difficulty": 3,
      "estimated_minutes": 7,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "参数对应验证",
          "steps": [
            "包络上点 $(-y^2,y)$ 满足 $t=y$"
          ]
        }
      ],
